#18136
Assassin dagger Quest 1~
   A small time assassin has been big, talking him self up as one of the
greats.  Your first task if you choose to accept it, will be to exterminate
this pest and show your worth.  Prove that he has been slain by returning to me
with his head in a bag and his dagger in your hand.  The information I have on
this so-called "great" assassin is that he is of the Minotaur race and is clad
in all black leather.    
~
   Kill a minotaur assassin who is clad in black Leather.  Return me his wicked
dagger.    
~
50 60 134225656 75 30 15
O MOB 2332
O OBJ 2339
R QP 3
I may keep you around yet, young assassin.    
~
#18137
Assassin dagger quest 2~
   Just after you accepted your task, so did another.  I wont go into the
details of his assignment but let's just say he failed poorly.  The person who
he was hired to kill has already hired his own mercenaries to track him down
and torture who hired him.  This cannot be allowed to happen, make haste and
silence this failure before he is found.  Last information I have was that he
has fled into a dark forest filled with creatures of myth.  I gave him a
special dagger to use on his mission, a Kindjal of sorts and I require this
item back so I may store it away.    
~
Silence the thief who hides in the dark forest and return with his Kindjal.  

~
50 60 142614256 75 30 15
P 18136
O MOB 40509
O OBJ 40504
R QP 3
   Ahh, my Kindjal, what was I thinking giving it to a young novice.  Luckily
you returned it before it could be tracked back to me.  Here is your payment
for services rendered.    
~
#18138
Assassin dagger quest 3~
   An assassin has been making his way up through our ranks in the foreign
guilds.  Last reports was that he and his comrades had succeeded in finding a
way into the Githyanki keep and attempted to assassinate the Lord of the keep
himself.  Did you notice I said, "attempted" and that it was, a failed attempt.
I require you to now track down this Drow Assassin who hides underdark of
night, take care of him quietly And finish what he started.  I want the Lord
dead so that I may collect the bounty.  Don't worry you'll receive your share.
Now go!    
~
   Slay the drow assassin and finish what he started.    
~
50 60 142614256 100 30 15
P 18137
O MOB 20672
O MOB 4214
R GOLD 1000000
   The skill you have is surprising.  If you keep up this work rate, we'll both
be out of work.  I have heard reports that Githyanki keep is in lock down and
chaos fills there halls, Good work!    
~
#18139
assassin dagger quest 4~
   You are surprising me with each assignment you complete.  I think it's time
we search for those rare bounties.  Your skill with the dagger and the stealth
in which you work is one of rare quality.  Recently a young dwarf prince left a
message that his father, the Great King Bregnar's time has passed and he wishes
to succeed in the throne.  The death must look like he died of natural causes.
I know you are good, but are able to complete this task?  If you complete it
the bounty is a horde of gold that will keep us Both happy for a long time yet.
  
~
   Kill King Bregnar and return his head.    
~
50 60 142614256 50 30 15
P 18138
O MOB 4880
R GOLD 1000000
   The walls are already talking of King Bregnar's Death.  No one suspects a
thing, A masterful stroke of work.  The young prince is already preparing to
succeed the throne as the new ruler.  What a tyrant he will be, Alas that is
not our problem, we are mere puppets in this ordeal.  Here is your share of the
bounty.    
~
#18140
assassin dagger quest 5~
   Another big assignment has reached my ears.  The Great King Turra XIV has
been making strange and unusual rulings of late.  His advisor Crenshin has been
found to be in bed with spies of King Heldane IV.  King Turra's original
advisor Darlandin wants this traitors head on a platter and the assassination
to be public.  You may use your weapon of choice to take care of this matter.
  
~
   Slay Crenshin the king's advisor.    
~
50 60 142614256 75 30 15
P 18139
O MOB 27706
R EXP 1000000
   You're back already?!  Amazing, truly amazing.  I take it Crenshin has been
disposed of, one can only imagine the stroke of genius you conjured up, you'll
have to tell me the story one day.    
~
#18141
assassin dagger quest 6~
   A messenger from King Snurre, Ruler of the Black Tower has been discretely
searching out mercenaries for a mission that requires the skilled mind of an
assassin.  Recently a warlock has gone rogue within his domain and summoned
forth an ancestor of his.  They have tried conventional methods and brute force
to slay This undead spectre but nothing has succeeded.  Without allowing the
general population to become aware of the trouble occurring, he would like this
matter taken care of discreetly.  Anyone that manages to succeed will be
rewarded richly.    
~
   Find and slay King Snurre's undead ancestor.    
~
50 60 142614256 100 30 15
P 18140
O MOB 40335
R QP 10
   I am almost speechless at how far you've mastered the art of death.  I did
not think even you would succeed in completing this task.  Truly astonishing,
and this is what the undead look like?  Grossly disfigured it is, burn that
head promptly before we both die of the plague.    
~
#18142
assassin dagger quest 7~
   I owe a favor to someone from long ago and it is time for me to pay this
debt.  He is in search of a shimmering cube.  It is rumored a guardian wanders
through the realm holding such an item.  Return this item to me so that I may
pay this debt.    
~
   Find a shimmering cube
~
50 60 142614256 200 30 15
P 18141
O OBJ 18198
R QP 5
   What a magnificent object this is.  I would almost keep it for myself as a
treasure to show off to guests, but yet this cannot be the way.  I appreciate
your haste in returning this to me and I am grateful you accepted this quest on
my behalf.  We are men of the trade you and I.    
~
#18143
assassin dagger quest 8~
   You have completed every task I have set forth and your accomplishments have
been heard around the realm and even to the ears of the Grand Master himself.
For you now there is nothing left to do but take the title you deserve.  We are
no longer men in business you and I, what but what I would like to consider two
old friends, who have been through a lot together.  It is time for me to retire
and attempt to have a normal life with the luxuries I would deserve.  Old age
has ravaged my body and what is left I will use to indulge myself.  But before
I die I would like to see you become the true Grand Master and take the title
and dagger that you rightly deserve.  Will you attempt this for me?  Old
friend?    
~
   Slay the Grand master and return with his head and dagger.    
~
50 60 142614264 150 30 15
P 18142
O MOB 15124
O OBJ 15150
R OBJ 18136
   Do my eyes deceive me have you returned, by the looks of that signet cloak I
believe you have bested the old Grand Master, I think congratulations is in
order!  After all we have been through it is perplexing to know that through
tasks given to me you have grown to be the Great Assassin of our time.  I have
one final item locked away that I would give to you before you leave.  It is a
dagger that I dare not use the power that emanates from it does not allow a
Grandfather like me to wield it.  I think our Lives were entwined you and I,
and that this Dagger has been waiting here, for you, so that it may finally be
used by a true, Grand Master of the Assassins.    
~
#18150
Ruby -- > DragonQ:Iridescent Dragon Scale~
   In the mountains north of Samsera, a great battle once raged, known as the
DragonWar.  The reason for the battle has long since been forgotten.  However,
the scars it left on the land have not.  Those that have traveled through the
mountain range have told me they've actually seen huge dragon scales half
buried in the rock and dirt.  Scour the area until you find such a marvel and
bring it back to me.    
~
Search the Northern Mountain Range for a dragon scale.
~
35 50 8388608 10 30 15
G 18048
O OBJ 6701
R SPELL 69
   Oh, this is truly amazing!  The scale is so light, yet the sharpest steel
makes no scratch on it.  All the more reason to fear these mythical creatures
of power.  Give me some time to work with this dragon scale and come back
later.  Until than, may this spell protect you upon your adventures.    
~
#18151
Ruby --> DragonQ:Mithril Ore~
   I need something to reinforce the shape of the iridescent dragon scale.  
However, I can not use ordinary metal or it will sacrifice the properties of
the scale.  Ages past, dwarves discovered a type of ore that they named
mithril.  The dwarven miners use to be quite friendly and would openly trade
the precious metal.  However, I've heard stories that their appearance and
manner has drastically changed.  No matter, find me some mithril so I may
reinforce this dragon scale.    
~
   Mithril is required to reinforce the iridescent dragon scale, find some and
bring it to Ruby.    
~
35 50 8388608 15 30 15
G 18048
P 18150
O OBJ 4930
R GOLD 200000
   Oh my, this ore is extraordinary, never would of I imagined the raw product
would be so beautiful.  I can use some to reinforce this scale and the rest I
can sale off.  I shall give you some gold for the profit I will make off the
sale.  Take 200000 &10gold coins&00 as payment.  Come back in awhile, I shall
have your new dragon scale shield finished!    
~
#18152
Ruby -->DragonQ:White Dragon~
   It appears the iridescent dragon scale does not hold enough power to ward
off the different types of dragon breath attacks.  I need to stop the bitter
cold of frost dragons.  Find me a white dragon and bring back its head so I may
remove some of the scales.  I have heard that one resides in a lair along a
mountain trail around the village of Galoe.    
~
   Seek deep beneath the earth for your answers.  Travel to the village of
Galoe and seek out a white dragon.  Bring back the head to Ruby.    
~
35 50 8388608 15 30 15
G 18048
P 18151
O MOB 18376
R QP 1
   Excellent, you have proved your valor and might by slaying such a beast.  
Take this 1 &10Quest Point&00 as a reward for the hunt.  Now, leave me be for awhile, I
must carefully extract some of the scales from the head of this frost dragon.
  
~
#18153
Ruby --> DragonQ:Great Dragon Wyvn~
   It now becomes necessary that we shall need to enforce the shield against
the fiery breath of red dragons.  I seem to remember a fellow by the name of
Jarwin that was in search of a great dragon.  He had mentioned that the beast
resided between the conscious and unconscious state of mind.  Perhaps you can
pick up his trail and find this dragon before he does.  If you succeed in
finding the dragon, destroy it and bring me back the head of this creature.  

~
   Find the dragon Jarwin was in search of and kill it before he does.  Bring
the head back to Ruby.    
~
35 50 8388608 15 30 15
G 18048
P 18152
O MOB 15235
R GOLD 300000
   Oh we're in luck!  The Wyvn was in fact a variant of the red dragon.  I can
now remove some of the scales to fortify the shield against fiery breath
attacks.  The head of this beast is magnificent, I believe I will mount it in
my shop.  I shall have to pay you for such an extraordinary trophy.  Take
300000 &10gold coins&00 as payment.    
~
#18154
Ruby --> DragonQ:Grand Bronze Dragon~
   I always thought lighting and dragons were a bad mix.  This is especially
true when the lighting is spewing out of the dragon's mouth.  Obviously we must
do something to enforce the shield against such an attack.  However, this poses
a problem.  The only creature I know that fits this species of dragon is the
mother of the great "Dragonriders".  Do not take this task lightly, her
ferocity is unmatched by most of the denizens of land.  Good luck my friend.  

~
   Kill the mother of all bronze dragons and bring the head back to Ruby.    
~
