elite royal guardsman --> Green Dragon~
A quest you ask of me?!?
I'll give you more than a quest, I'll give you one hell of a nasty job.
The trade route between Midgaard and Samsera is in serious jeopardy.
An enormous green dragon has built its lair in the northern Haon-Dor forest.
It's been sacking caravans, gorging on the traders, and flying away with the loot.
I would have taken care of this myself...
but I wouldn't want to abandon my post here, don't you see?
It's up to you to get rid of this evil monstrosity, now hurry!
~
Travel the Great Western Road, search out the lair of a green dragon, and slay the beast!
~
